<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2025-01 on ʀᴇꜱᴇᴀʀᴄʜ ɴᴏᴛᴇ</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/tags/2025-01/</link><description>Recent content in 2025-01 on ʀᴇꜱᴇᴀʀᴄʜ ɴᴏᴛᴇ</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://younsoid.github.io/tags/2025-01/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>대학원생 면접대비캠프</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/study/career/career0/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/study/career/career0/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="대학원생-면접대비캠프"&gt;&#10; 대학원생 면접대비캠프&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%8c%80%ed%95%99%ec%9b%90%ec%83%9d-%eb%a9%b4%ec%a0%91%eb%8c%80%eb%b9%84%ec%ba%a0%ed%94%84"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2025-01-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;대학원생 대상으로 면접대비 강의가 있길래 신청해봤다!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/edc9aec6-56f9-4d51-b802-7351cf31183c" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;화수목은 5시부터 9시이구 금요일은 1시부터 6시반이라서 금요일은 일찍 퇴근할수있으면 퇴근하고 듣는게 좋을듯. 토요일은 10시부터 오프라인으로 한다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이번주 랩미팅이 목요일 2시에 있고 논문 미팅은 금요일 아침 9시라서 크게 겹치지는 않아 매우 다행이다!!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id=""&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#1 1일차 - 면접 기초&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;1.9 오후 7시에 질문 받음.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;1.10은 논문 기반 세미나 pt 면접 시뮬레이션. 목요일에 신청받는다.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;토요일 모의면접 일정(오늘 9시에 신청)&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6917d9e1-f04c-4ae8-ae67-896a8c7cc39e" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;-&amp;gt; 경북대학교 복지관 4층.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.onoffmix.com/event/315732"&gt;https://www.onoffmix.com/event/315732&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>